From bb845eb2589fd537a30ac4b917747db08b4fd4fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Orhan=20K=C3=B6kbudak?= <spitintomyjar@protonmail.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:46:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Map mods: read HashFS v1 archives and load extra .scs
 (--mod), tolerate what mods do differently

Reads version-1 archives (how mods are packed), adds parser --mod (loaded after
the game's files, last wins), accepts plain-text names, mixed-case unit names and
prefabs whose dummy points are not last, skips broken mod sectors with a warning,
and lets dealer labels, ferries and service areas from mods be unusual instead
of failing the whole map build.
